Build your own box: a demo that designs, prices, opens and runs a box with the Misty mechanism

- /build: name, price, credit unit, outcomes (piece / credit / credit + free
  spins) with worth, free spins and chance; live cost per row, total against
  the price, what you keep, return on screen and really; Fit button that
  scales the piece odds to a target return; free-spin table; open the box
  with commitment, result, bands and check; run thousands of opens with the
  Misty runner and results; save or load the design as JSON; starters
- engine: MistyConfig.customBox carried through opener, verifier and runner;
  boxOf helper; fitItemOdds solver; MistyBox.creditName
- BoxMaths exported from the Misty stage; nav entry; links from the Misty
  page banner and both docs pages; README

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
